223             qua<T, Q>::wxyz({\cf17 static_cast<}T{\cf17 >}(0), {\cf17 static_cast<}T{\cf17 >}(0), {\cf17 static_cast<}T{\cf17 >}(0), {\cf17 static_cast<}T{\cf17 >}(0)));\par
